WEBVTT

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:12.735
<v><b>P:</b></v> Good afternoon.

00:00:13.147 --> 00:00:13.856
Can I help you?

00:00:14.096 --> 00:00:16.708
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, I hurt my back.

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:26.663
I need something for the pain.

00:00:34.118 --> 00:00:34.748
<v><b>P:</b></v> Of course.

00:00:34.749 --> 00:00:35.726
How did you hurt it?

00:00:37.076 --> 00:00:40.407
<v><b>B:</b></v> Well, I was moving some heavy boxes this morning.

00:00:53.131 --> 00:00:57.037
<v><b>P:</b></v> OK, I see…Are you allergic to any medicines?

00:00:57.511 --> 00:00:58.197
<v><b>B:</b></v> No.

00:01:06.373 --> 00:01:08.298
<v><b>P:</b></v> Are you on any medication?

00:01:08.884 --> 00:01:09.810
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, I’m not.

00:01:17.946 --> 00:01:18.906
<v><b>P:</b></v> No problem.

00:01:21.345 --> 00:01:22.628
This is ibuprofen.

00:01:22.865 --> 00:01:23.873
It will help with the pain.

00:01:24.994 --> 00:01:25.418
<v><b>B:</b></v> Great.

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:34.871
How many do I have to take?

00:01:42.455 --> 00:01:44.687
<v><b>P:</b></v> Take two, every four to six hours,

00:01:44.727 --> 00:01:47.992
and if it isn’t better in two or three days, go and see your doctor.

00:01:48.443 --> 00:01:50.273
<v><b>B:</b></v> OK, thanks.

00:01:57.807 --> 00:01:59.167
How much is that?

00:02:06.708 --> 00:02:08.031
<v><b>P:</b></v> Three ninety-nine, please.

00:02:08.956 --> 00:02:09.548
<v><b>B:</b></v> Thank you.

00:02:17.277 --> 00:02:17.941
<v><b>P:</b></v> You’re welcome.